        {
          "text": " Mushoboravyose avuze ati: “Kuri uwo musi, urumambo rwashimangiwe ahakomeye ruzokurwaho; ruzotemwa rugwe, umutwaro wari uruboheweko ukoroke.” Ni ko ",
